**MemoService is served over two protocols: gRPC-Gateway (HTTP/REST) and Connect RPC.**

---

## 1. gRPC-Gateway (HTTP/REST)

**Registration site:** `/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/v1.go`

MemoService is registered on the gRPC-Gateway mux inside `RegisterGateway`:

```108:110:/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/v1.go
	if err := v1pb.RegisterMemoServiceHandlerServer(ctx, gwMux, s); err != nil {
		return err
	}
```

That mux is mounted on Echo at `/api/v1/*`:

```126:128:/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/v1.go
	handler := echo.WrapHandler(http.MaxBytesHandler(gwMux, maxAPIRequestBytes))

	gwGroup.Any("/api/v1/*", handler)
```

The function comment in the same file confirms both protocols are registered together:

```64:67:/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/v1.go
